== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vminmaxpd [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F3A, OPC: 0x52]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 64
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AVX512
    ISA-SET: AVX512_MINMAX_512
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E2
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 33 C5 5B 52 E3 18 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT     RCW     MODRM_REG    512      8      64   FLOAT64                        zmm12
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R          MASK     64     64       1       INT                           k3
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD    512      8      64   FLOAT64                         zmm7
 3   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM    512      8      64   FLOAT64                        zmm19
 4  IMMEDIATE    EXPLICIT       R         UIMM8      8      1       8      UINT  [U A  8] 0x0000000000000018
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 512
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: Y
       MASK: k3 [MERGING]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vminmaxpd $0x18, %zmm19 {sae}, %zmm7, %zmm12 {%k3}
   RELATIVE: vminmaxpd $0x18, %zmm19 {sae}, %zmm7, %zmm12 {%k3}

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vminmaxpd zmm12 {k3}, zmm7, zmm19 {sae}, 0x18
   RELATIVE: vminmaxpd zmm12 {k3}, zmm7, zmm19 {sae}, 0x18

